+ * Ask for a RANGE on VPROC2, not a point.
+ *
+ * The regulator core aggregates consumers by INTERSECTION, not by maximum: it
+ * takes the highest min_uV and the lowest max_uV across everyone holding the
+ * rail, and returns -EINVAL if what is left is empty. So the shape of this
+ * request decides whether another consumer can coexist. mediatek-cpufreq asks
